// their own, without presuming the learner has already met أفعال القلوب in
// this app, since that module doesn't exist yet. l2-l3 then close out the
// أفعال القلوب topic proper: the three-object family, what a جملة sadding
// مسد the two مفعولين does to the فعل's عمل (التعليق), every trigger that
// forces it, and الإلغاء, which cancels that عمل outright.
//
