// worked examples for the اسم مؤول/جملة/الفعل الشبيه material (يريهم,
// اعلموا أن الله, يبلوكم, سلهم) run out at four genuinely parseable
// sentences; the شهد example is explicitly flagged in the source itself as
// illustrating its point "less cleanly" and was left out of the bank rather
// than forced in. L1 and L3 each hit six.
